<title>ARGENTINA: Argentine Central Bank reserves detailed.</title>
<headline>Argentine Central Bank reserves detailed.</headline>
<dateline>BUENOS AIRES 1997-04-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Argentine Central Bank Friday released the following international reserve and currency liability data, in millions:</p>
<p>*A = International reserves (gold, currency, securities, including repos and reverse repos).</p>
<p> B = Liquidity requirements.</p>
<p> C = International reserves in the financial system.</p>
<p>*D = Monetary base.</p>
<p> E = Currency liabilities.</p>
<p> F = Net repurchase tender agreements.</p>
<p> G = Bank liquidity paper.</p>
<p> H = Financial liabilities.</p>
<p>Date	*A*   *B*    *C*    *D*    *E*   *F*  *G*   *H*</p>
<p>Mar 26  20,141 5,387 25,528 13,326 13,330 5,260  0  18,590</p>
<p>Mar 31  19,803 5,355 25,158 13,371 13,374 5,131  0  18,505</p>
<p>Apr 01  19,939 5,342 25,281 13,332 13,348 5,321  0  18,669</p>
<p>Apr 02  20,045 5,377 25,422 13,399 13,418 5,354  0  18,772</p>
<p>Apr 03  20,079 5,261 25,340 13,538 13,554 5,233  0  18,787</p>
<p>Apr 04  20,105 5,250 25,355 13,692 13,708 5,112  0  18,820</p>
<p>Apr 07  19,906 5,257 25,163 13,793 13,809 4,884  0  18,693</p>
<p>Apr 08  19,942 5,298 25,240 13,717 13,745 4,972  0  18,717</p>
<p>Apr 09  19,891 5,407 25,298 13,668 13,697 4,963  0  18,660</p>
<p>*A  Of the $19.89 billion in international reserves, $1.63 billion (8.19 percent) are in securities.</p>
<p>*D  There are currently no peso-denominated current accounts at the Central Bank.</p>
<p>((--Buenos Aires Newsroom +54 1 318-0651))</p>
</text>
